2202:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * The status bits are located at their bitpositions in the TRBSR register in the returned value.
2203:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * User can make use of the XMC_USIC_CH_RXFIFO_EVENT enumeration for checking the status of return 
2204:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * The status can be found by using the bitwise AND operation on the returned value with the enumer
