 110:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * @brief Synchronous serial channel driver for SPI-like communication.
 111:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  *
 112:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * The SPI driver uses Universal Serial Interface Channel(USIC) module.
 113:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * The USIC module supports multiple data lines for SPI communication. \n
 114:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Full duplex communication with 2 separate lines for transmission and reception.
 115:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Half duplex communication with 1 common line shared for transmission and reception.
 116:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Dual mode communication with 2 common lines shared for transmission and reception.
 117:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Quad mode communication with 4 common lines shared for transmission and reception.<br><br>
 118:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  *
 119:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * SPI driver provides structures, enumerations and APIs for configuring the USIC channel for SPI c
 120:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * and also for data transaction.<br>
 121:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * SPI driver features:
 122:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Configuration structure XMC_SPI_CH_CONFIG_t and SPI initialization function XMC_SPI_CH_Init()
 123:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Allows configuration of protocol word and frame length using XMC_SPI_CH_SetWordLength(), XMC_
 124:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Allows manipulation of data frame at runtime using XMC_SPI_CH_EnableSOF(), XMC_SPI_CH_EnableE
 125:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  XMC_SPI_CH_EnableSlaveSelect(), XMC_SPI_CH_DisableSlaveSelect()
 126:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Provides APIs for transmitting data and receiving data using XMC_SPI_CH_Transmit(), XMC_SPI_C
 127:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Allows configuration of shift clock using XMC_SPI_CH_ConfigureShiftClockOutput()
 128:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Provides enumeration of SPI protocol events using @ref XMC_SPI_CH_STATUS_FLAG_t
 129:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * @{
