 801:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * Enables the delay after each word, by setting PCR.TIWEN bit.\n\n
 802:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * The inter word delay starts at the end of last SCLK cycle of data word. During this time no cloc
 803:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * generated and MSLS signal stays active. If inter word delay is not enabled, last data bit of a d
 804:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * followed by the first data bit of the next data word. This is not enabled in XMC_SPI_CH_Init(). 
 805:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * XMC_SPI_CH_EnableInterwordDelay() has to be invoked as needed in the program. And can be disable
 806:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * XMC_SPI_CH_DisableInterwordDelay().
