 841:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * Configures the inter word delay by setting PCR.PCTQ1, PCR.DCTQ1 bit fields.\n\n
 842:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * The inter word delay is dependent on the peripheral clock. The maximum possible value is calcula
