 844:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  *            Maximum inter word delay = ((1 + PCTQ1_max)(1 + DCTQ1_max)) / peripheral clock\n
 845:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  *                                       where PCTQ1_max = 3 and DCTQ1_max = 31\n
 846:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * After configuring the inter word delay, this has to be enabled by invoking XMC_SPI_CH_EnableInte
