1013:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * considered as first word of a new frame by finishing the currently running frame. For software h
1014:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * it is recommended to configure TCSR.WLEMD as 0. This is not configured during initialization. XM
1015:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * can be called as needed in the program and can be disabled by XMC_SPI_CH_DisableSOF().
